^{2}}{4}.$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the equation of an elliptic paraboloid centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\nz=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nThus, an elliptic paraboloid centered at $O$ whose axis of symmetry is the $x$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\nx=\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is an elliptic paraboloid whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis and $b=\\sqrt{2},\\,c=2.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167145 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "318f129c-066d-50bd-934a-90722ba4fc93" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Image of a Vector Under a Matrix Given Solutions to a Matrix ODE"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f9197b3a-daef-5748-b56e-01e3af4bfd2f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "Aw = \\begin{bmatrix}2\\cos t \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186163919} {:answer/id #uuid "03094baa-c772-57fc-9da4-e59e3108116a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "Aw = \\begin{bmatrix}-\\cos t - \\sin t \\\\ \\cos t + \\sin t\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186163920} {:answer/id #uuid "14ce473c-426f-50b4-9473-734d3ccf55b4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "Aw = \\begin{bmatrix}\\cos t + \\sin t \\\\ \\cos t - \\sin t\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186163921} {:answer/id #uuid "1914ee99-493c-59e5-b5d2-795d9343f142" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "Aw = \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2\\sin t\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186163922} {:answer/id #uuid "74b9889f-55b7-539d-8dcc-2811905ad068" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "Aw = \\begin{bmatrix}\\cos t - \\sin t \\\\ \\sin t - \\cos t\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186163923}] :answer-field/id #uuid "64df5254-9dc1-5914-9459-23645b031940" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.ty